<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">An RDMA-First Object Storage System with SmartNIC Offload</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_conference"><span class="ltx_note_name">Conference: </span>Workshops of the International Conference for High Performance Computing, Networking, Storage and Analysis; November 16–21, 2025; St Louis, MO, USA</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_booktitle">Workshops of the International Conference for High Performance Computing, Networking, Storage and Analysis (SC Workshops ’25), November 16–21, 2025, St Louis, MO, USA</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_doi"><span class="ltx_note_name">DOI: </span><a href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3731599.3767522">10.1145/3731599.3767522</a></span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_isbn"><span class="ltx_note_name">ISBN: </span>979-8-4007-1871-7/2025/11</span></span></span>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yu Zhu
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
